 "summary": "Three single Schottky diodes in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 1 A average rectified current and 25 A surge. They differ only in reverse voltage rating: 20 V (B5817W), 30 V (B5818W) and 40 V (B5819W), with forward drop at 1 A of 0.45 V, 0.55 V and 0.60 V maximum. They switch fast with high conductance, for general-purpose switching, in a package suited to machine placement.",
